    "method": "Each table read from the scanned page images (rendered at 110 dpi) and every cell compared with the P1-08 head-start table. Per grade, the sum of the required subjects was checked against the decree's printed 'Total JP Mata Pelajaran Wajib' row, and the derived ranges with muatan lokal and the elective against the printed total rows. All match."
